English summary

Copyright © 2026 Jordan Goussery. All rights reserved. You may play the game
for free at its official address (https://amael-alt.github.io/elelhem/), share
that link anywhere, show screenshots with credit, and read the code on GitHub.
You may not copy, host, embed, modify, adapt or reuse any part of it (code,
texts, characters, artwork, music), even for free or for teaching, nor use it
to train AI models, without the author's written permission. GitHub's terms
allow viewing and forking on GitHub only; they grant no further rights.
three.js (MIT) and EB Garamond (SIL OFL 1.1) keep their own licenses.
Permission requests: https://maintenant-vous-savez.com/contact
